{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2],"title":[{"Plain":"生象的无穷范畴"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"无穷群胚的无穷范畴"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>生象的范畴 $\\mathsf{Ani}$ 是最基本的 "},{"Local":{"url":"无穷意象","text":"∞-意象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$\\mathsf{Ani}$ 是一个点在"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":"下自由生成的范畴.</p>\n"}]}}